Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 01:21:42 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Stereo 3D and Deep Colour information page

Show what each graphics card and each connected display can do in
stereo 3D and deep colour, and what it is doing now, next to the EDID
page in the graphical information category.

The page shows the output of stereo-display-info, as the Vulkan page
shows vulkaninfo, and says so when the command is not installed. Under
the text, each display has its EDID look-up tag with a copy button and
two buttons that open the public EDID collections in the browser; its
colour profile opens Display settings, and DisplayCAL can be started
when it is installed. Nothing is changed or sent until a button is
pressed.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet via Claude Code
